<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT ZIMBABWE IN SHARJAH CUP MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT ZIMBABWE IN SHARJAH CUP MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat Zimbabwe by 93 runs in their Sharjah Cup cricket match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Pakistan 187 all out in 50 overs, Zimbabwe 94 all out in 31.4 overs.</p>
</text>
